lib/puppet/feature/augeas.rb                  augeasproviders_core 4.2.0
lib/puppet/provider/augeasprovider/default.rb augeasproviders_core 4.2.0
lib/puppet/type/augeasprovider.rb             augeasproviders_core 4.2.0

Do not edit: TestAugeasFixturesMatchManifests (internal/units) requires each
file's sha256 to equal the digest in ../manifest.go.

augeas/traces/ holds copies of four recordings that this package's tests replay
(01a, 02b, 02e, 07b); the originals live in the augeasproviders_sysctl and
augeasproviders_ssh units' testdata/augeas/traces, whose README says how they
were recorded. Do not edit them either.
